1. Definitions / 定义
   "Software" / 「本软件」: the Jwork desktop application, its source code,
   documentation and installation packages.
   「本软件」：Jwork 桌面应用及其源代码、文档与安装包。
   "Personal Use" / 「个人使用」: use by a natural person for non-commercial
   purposes, including personal study, research and hobby projects.
   「个人使用」：自然人出于非商业目的的使用，含个人学习、研究与兴趣项目。
   "Commercial Use" / 「商业使用」: any use primarily intended for commercial
   advantage or monetary compensation, including but not limited to use in the
   business operations of for-profit organizations, integration into commercial
   products or services, and paid redistribution.
   「商业使用」：主要以商业利益或金钱回报为目的的使用，包括但不限于营利性组织
   内部业务使用、集成进商业产品或服务、有偿再分发。

